Rebalance_childToSameChild
├── given the active strategy is Child Aave V3
├── and TVL was created through a real parent epoch deposit to Child
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should keep the rebalance pending
├── when CRE executes rebalance through Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should withdraw all TVL from Child Aave V3
├── and ChildVault should deposit the TVL into Child Aave V4 locally
├── and ChildVault should not send rebalance funds through CCIP
├── when CRE completes rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Child Aave V4
